Chapter: DeskHoverTest
  cites Works chapter GopDesk
  cites UI chapter BoxModel

 Pins the hover dwell the preview bubble is gated on: which pill the pointer
 is resting on, and for how long.

 THE TICK IS A PARAMETER, WHICH IS THE ONLY REASON THIS CHAPTER CAN EXIST.
 `desk.ps1 -Rtc` pins the HPET as well as the CMOS, so a scripted capture with
 a frozen clock can never satisfy a dwell -- the same reason the flick has no
 capture arm. Passing `now` in makes the whole of the timing testable with
 synthetic values and no framebuffer.

Section: Fixture

 A tick rate of 1000 makes one tick one millisecond, so the dwell threshold of
 400 ms is 400 ticks and the arithmetic is readable. The real HPET runs at
 about 14 MHz and the same division carries it.

  dh-tps : Integer = 1000

 The bubble cases are chosen so the two SHIFT directions disagree with the
 unshifted answer. A pill in the middle of a bottom band is centred on it; one
 four pixels from the left would start at -15 and is pushed to 0; one near the
 right would end at 1669 and is pulled back to 1472. A case that never leaves
 the glass cannot tell a fit from no fit at all.

  dh-xy : LayoutRect -> Text
  dh-xy (r) = show (r.lr-x) & " " & show (r.lr-y)

Section: Main

  opening : [Console] Nothing =
    let ds = alloc-zeroed 256 64
    in let n1 = dk-hover-note ds desk-focus-files 10000
    in let held0 = dk-hover-held ds 10000 dh-tps
    in let held1 = dk-hover-held ds 10399 dh-tps
    in let ready1 = dk-hover-ready ds 10399 dh-tps
    in let held2 = dk-hover-held ds 10400 dh-tps
    in let ready2 = dk-hover-ready ds 10400 dh-tps
    in let n2 = dk-hover-note ds desk-focus-bro 10500
    in let held3 = dk-hover-held ds 10600 dh-tps
    in let ready3 = dk-hover-ready ds 10600 dh-tps
    in let n3 = dk-hover-note ds desk-focus-bro 10700
    in let held4 = dk-hover-held ds 10900 dh-tps
    in let n4 = dk-hover-note ds desk-focus-none 11000
    in act
    print-line-uni ("noted: " & show n1 & " " & show n2 & " " & show n3)
    print-line-uni ("held: " & show held0 & " " & show held1 & " " & show held2)
    print-line-uni ("ready: " & dk-yn ready1 & " " & dk-yn ready2)
    print-line-uni ("moved: " & show held3 & " " & dk-yn ready3)
    print-line-uni ("restated: " & show held4)
    print-line-uni ("none: " & show (dk-hover-held ds 12000 dh-tps) & " " & dk-yn (dk-hover-ready ds 12000 dh-tps))
    print-line-uni ("bub-bottom: " & dh-xy (dk-prev-bubble 200 840 90 40 dk-edge-bottom 1600 900))
    print-line-uni ("bub-lo-shift: " & dh-xy (dk-prev-bubble 4 840 90 40 dk-edge-bottom 1600 900))
    print-line-uni ("bub-hi-shift: " & dh-xy (dk-prev-bubble 1560 840 90 40 dk-edge-bottom 1600 900))
    print-line-uni ("bub-left: " & dh-xy (dk-prev-bubble 10 300 56 40 dk-edge-left 1600 900))
    print-line-uni ("bub-right: " & dh-xy (dk-prev-bubble 1534 300 56 40 dk-edge-right 1600 900))
    print-line-uni ("bub-top: " & dh-xy (dk-prev-bubble 200 10 90 40 dk-edge-top 1600 900))
    print-line-uni ("bub-size: " & show ((dk-prev-bubble 200 840 90 40 dk-edge-bottom 1600 900).lr-w) & " " & show ((dk-prev-bubble 200 840 90 40 dk-edge-bottom 1600 900).lr-h))
  end
